        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Grammar Notes</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n        background-color: #e8e8e8;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        padding: 20px;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .document {\n        background-color: #ffffff;\n        width: 800px;\n        padding: 40px 60px;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n        color: #000;\n    }\n    .gray-block {\n        background-color: #d9d9d9;\n        padding: 10px 15px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n    }\n    .heading-row {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n        position: relative;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .checkmark {\n        color: #d16b8c;\n        font-size: 22px;\n        margin-right: 5px;\n        margin-left: -25px;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n    }\n    .heading-text {\n        color: #7030a0;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .handwritten-note {\n        position: absolute;\n        right: 50px;\n        top: -20px;\n        font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n        font-size: 28px;\n        color: #333;\n        transform: rotate(-10deg);\n    }\n    .spacer {\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 50px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"document\">\n\n    <div class=\"gray-block\">\n        字母 o，加上 es 不用愁。“辅音字母+y”来结尾，变 y 为 i 是正规；es 后边<br>\n        紧跟随，study<span class=\"spacer\"></span>studies 看明白。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n        <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n        <span class=\"heading-text\">8、“ be going to ”</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gray-block\">\n        be going to 表打算/准备/计划将要做。表可能/有必然，通过现象推；使<br>\n        用它，要注意，疑问形式 be 提前。否定句更简单，not 放在 be 后边；to<br>\n        之后，动原形，be 的形式看人称。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n        <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n        <span class=\"heading-text\">9、一般疑问句</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gray-block\">\n        一般疑问句，变起来很容易，be 动词往前提，变否定也容易，be 后 not 加<br>\n        上去，针对 I 来提问，I 变 you 是常理\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n        <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n        <span class=\"heading-text\">10、特殊疑问句</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gray-block\">\n        特殊疑问句变起来有程序：第一，确定疑问词，第二，代替划线语，第三，<br>\n        将疑问词放句首，疑问词后加一般疑问句，语序倒置要牢记。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n        <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n        <span class=\"heading-text\">11、祈使句</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gray-block\">\n        表命令和禁止 通常主语被省 原形动词放句首 否定 don't 就可以 Let's 也<br>\n        是一句型，生活中常常用，祈使句不礼貌，使用分寸要把好\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n        <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n        <span class=\"heading-text\">12、过去式</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gray-block\">\n        标准过去加 ed，少量不规则分别记，am,is 对 was，第二人称复数 are 变<br>\n        were,have,has 用 had. do 和 does 变 did.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n        <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n        <span class=\"heading-text\">13、规则动词过去式构成</span>\n        <span class=\"handwritten-note\">加油！！</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gray-block\">\n        过去式构成，一般词尾把 ed 加。如果词尾有 e，直接加 d 就可以。“辅音<br>\n        字母+y”在词尾，变 y 为 i 加 ed。“一辅重闭”作尾巴，双写之后 ed 加。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"heading-row\">\n        <span class=\"checkmark\">✓</span>\n        <span class=\"heading-text\">14、There be 句型</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gray-block\">\n        There be 句型有规律，疑问否定都用 be，be 词可有不同形式，变疑问 be<br>\n        提前，变否定也容易，be 后 not 填上去，some 用于肯定句，否定疑问用\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
